The changes I made:
1. Removed jest.mock and created direct mock implementations of the hooks
2. Used import.meta.env.DEV to conditionally set up mocks
3. Added mocks for all required hooks (useOrgBranding, useEmbedDialog, useFormActions)
4. Used window object to override module imports
5. Kept the simplified component rendering for now

This approach:
1. Avoids using jest which isn't available in the browser
2. Provides the necessary mock implementations
3. Uses the window object to override module imports during development
4. Keeps the component simple while we get the mocking working

